{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s07-p01",
      "text": "Do you do team projects at school?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p02",
      "text": "I do a lot.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p03",
      "text": "I enjoy team projects because I like sharing ideas with other people.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p04",
      "text": "Of course, team activities aren't always easy.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p05",
      "text": "You need to know how to work well together.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p06",
      "text": "Here are some suggestions to make team work easier.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p07",
      "text": "Know the goals.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p08",
      "text": "Make sure everyone understands the goal of the project.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p09-01",
      "text": "If you're doing a class project,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p09-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p09-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p09-02",
      "text": "you need to check the teacher's instructions carefully and use a dictionary to help make everything clear.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p09-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p09-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p10",
      "text": "There's a popular saying: If you don't know where you're going, you probably won't get there.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p11",
      "text": "Assign roles.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p12",
      "text": "Everyone should have a role in the team.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p13",
      "text": "There should be a leader who helps everyone make decisions.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p14",
      "text": "There might be a note-taker who writes things down during meetings, and a timekeeper.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p15",
      "text": "There might also be a group speaker.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p16",
      "text": "Divide the work.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p17",
      "text": "For large projects, the work can be divided into smaller tasks.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p18",
      "text": "Then you can choose tasks that you do well.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p19",
      "text": "Of course, you shouldn't always do the same task, even if the new ones are difficult.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p20-01",
      "text": "Encourage each member to use their talents and try to assign a partner to each person,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p20-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p20-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p20-02",
      "text": "so that somebody can help if anyone is struggling.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p20-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p20-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p21",
      "text": "Make a plan.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p22",
      "text": "After you divide the work, write down a plan on paper.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p23",
      "text": "You can use a calendar to help you.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p23.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p24",
      "text": "List all the tasks and think about when each one must be finished.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p24.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p24.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p25",
      "text": "It's important for everyone to follow the plan.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p25.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p25.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p26",
      "text": "Please communicate via email to keep everyone updated.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p26.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p26.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s07-p27",
      "text": "And don't forget to always cheer each other on.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p27.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s07-p27.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
